  "fashion": {
    "Overview": "Burlesque fashion is inextricably tied to Cabaret but usually is more sensual and revealing in a performative setting. It is unlikely to see full-blown burlesque fashion in everyday settings due to its sexual nature, however hints of burlesque can be found in queer areas. For example, if someone wanted to emulate the burlesque aesthetic they'd likely dress in cabaret style for the sake of modesty."
